  Wait until you see what all those "you feel raised to your full
potential" results do to your mana.  (Talk about lust for power!)

  Practice leading pets without a leash (or tripe ration).  This
will also come in handy leading wraiths in the VotD (or off of a
graveyard level.)

  Once you've led all the soldiers to the altar, it's nice to 
combine with a sacrifest with the spell of Create Monster and the
Eye of Aethiopica.  Gives you something to do in between 
encounters.  

  (Be careful with Magicbane around foocubi - you don't want to
cancel any of your harem.  Naming them will give you a better
idea of which ones are currently receptive.  Skilled+ spell
of detect monster lasts for multiple turns, so you can see
where all your partners are at all times.)


  Plus you'll get more foocubi from the occasional same-race 
sacrifice created.  Remember, any human corpse, no matter how 
old, will still summon a major demon.  So human mummy/zombie
corpses go on the altar as well.


  Up your charisma first with magic traps.  (Requires care & 
preparation.)  Wizards gain one charisma point with a cornuthaum.
Rings of adornment can help, but if your total Cha isn't at least
20 the foocubi may take the ring during an encounter.

  You'll get both succubi and incubi.  Once you've run out of one
gender, use an amulet of change and use up the other.  (I've 
never quite had the nerve to do this.  It's a little squicky.)


  Google rgrn for my first mention of an "interaction nook."

